      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As noted in my post here; https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1244-fbt-legacy-calibration-menu-option-prevents-avatar-locomotion\nI found in addition to your notes that, upon relaunching VRChat in desktop mode later on with legacy calibration enabled, that I can no longer move at all whatsoever.\nAlso of note, this calibration option worked perfectly fine before this beta update, as that post above has the launch command as that's how it was enabled previously.",
